  "interpretation": {
    "geneformer_v1_10m": "GSE136103 and Liver_Atlas are encoder_seen. The other smoke-view and registered cell-state cohorts first became public after the V1 cutoff and are clean_declared, except sealed GSE289173, whose task labels are target_label_unexposed.",
    "geneformer_v2_104m": "GSE136103, GSE185477, and Liver_Atlas are encoder_seen. GSE174748, GSE189600, GSE202379, and GSE244832 were public before the V2 cutoff but have no declared source-table match and remain unknown. GSE256398, GSE281367, and GSE296875 are clean_declared by post-cutoff public dates; sealed GSE289173 is target_label_unexposed.",
    "geneformer_v2_316m": "GSE136103, GSE185477, and Liver_Atlas are encoder_seen. GSE174748, GSE189600, GSE202379, and GSE244832 were public before the V2 cutoff but have no declared source-table match and remain unknown. GSE256398, GSE281367, and GSE296875 are clean_declared by post-cutoff public dates; sealed GSE289173 is target_label_unexposed."
  },
